+/*
+ * edge_comp_mode 1: stretch the outer cell, as the EGoTouchRev service
+ * does.  A centroid within half a cell of the panel edge goes onto the
+ * edge, one between half a cell and 1.005 cells is spread linearly over
+ * 0..1.005 cells, and anything further in is left alone.  (The service
+ * takes the inner end of the first range from a log table indexed by the
+ * position along the edge, which comes out as 1/256 of a cell for all but
+ * the first eighth of each edge; this uses 1/256 throughout.)  @d is the
+ * distance from the edge in Q8 cells.
